---

import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/base-layout.astro";
import Link from "@/components/link.astro";---

<BaseLayout title="Kelsoncraft Rust">
    <h1 class="text-4xl text-indigo-500 text-center text-bold p-6">
        Kelsoncraft Rust
        <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells-row-lock dark:text-white text-black"></i>
    </h1>

    <p>
        I will be adding information to my Kelsoncraft Rust project to this page.
    </p>

    <p>
        This project has a Dev folder which contains my main development
        with Rust, and a esp32_test folder which contains ESP32 testing.
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-4xl text-indigo-500 text-center text-bold p-6">
        ESP32 Test
    </h1>

    <p>
        The esp32_test folder has SSD1306 display tests, LED toggling, Button testing, and a power LED that can be turned on.
    </p>

    <br>
    <p> Here is a list of the GPIO pins that I have used with my project.</p>

    <ul class="list-disc">
        <li>GPIO12 - Blue LED toggle button</li>
        <li>GPIO14 - Green LED toggle button</li>
        <li>GPIO21 - SDA for SSD1306</li>
        <li>GPIO22 - SCL for SSD1306</li>
        <li>GPIO25 - Blue LED</li>
        <li>GPIO26 - Red power LED (Always turned on, lets me know when code is running.)</li>
        <li>GPIO27 - Green LED</li>
    </ul>


    <h1 class="text-4xl text-indigo-500 text-center text-bold p-6">
        Project Git Repos
    </h1>
    <br>
    <p>
        Here is a list of git repos for my Kelsoncraft Rust project
    </p>
    <br>

    <ul class="list-disc">
        <li><Link href="https://github.com/kelson8/Kelsoncraft-Rust">GitHub</Link></li>
        <li><Link href="https://git.kelsoncraft.net/kelson8/Kelsoncraft-Rust">Self Hosted Forgejo</Link></li>
    </ul>

</BaseLayout>